        "title": "[2607.24771] RoCo-ACE: Rollout-Conditioned Online Distillation for Retention-Aware Knowledge Injection",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.24771: RoCo-ACE: Rollout-Conditioned Online Distillation for Retention-Aware Knowledge Injection",
